"text":" the Pacific or"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" through"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" Central"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" Asia. The pol"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ar adv"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"antage has"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" shrunk as a"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" result.\n- **Saf"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ety and"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" infrastructure:**"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" Polar routes dep"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"end on sat"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ellite communication"},{"type":"text_delta","text":", since"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" rad"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"io coverage is limited."},{"type":"text_delta","text":" They"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" also need emergency diversion"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" airports, and"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" there"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" are f"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ewer of"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" them in the Arctic."},{"type":"text_delta","text":" Weather can change"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" quickly, and search"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" and rescue is far"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" away"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"."},{"type":"text_delta","text":" Airlines and"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" reg"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ulators accept these risks because"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" the routes are well"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" plan"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ned and a"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ircraft are cert"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ified for long-"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"range"},{"type":"text_delta","text":","},{"type":"text_delta","text":" mult"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"i-engine operations"},{"type":"text_delta","text":".\n\nIn short, pol"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ar routes save"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" time"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" and fuel because"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" Earth is round"},{"type":"text_delta","text":", and air"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"lines adjust them for"},{"type":"text_delta","text":" win"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ds, airspace r"},{"type":"text_delta","text":"ules, and safety."},{"type":"completed","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"opaque","provider":"anthropic","kind":"thinking","data":{"signature":"","thinking":"","type":"thinking"}},{"type":"text","text":"Planes take polar routes mainly because they're shorter. On a globe, the shortest path between two points is a **great circle**, and from Toronto (about 43°N) to much of Asia, that arc passes over northern Canada, the Arctic, and Siberia. Flat maps hide this because the Mercator projection stretches high latitudes. A route that looks like it should go over the Pacific is often several hundred kilometres longer.\n\nShorter distance means:\n- **Less fuel**, which lowers cost and weight.\n- **Shorter flight times**, which also helps crews and passengers.\n\nOther factors shape the choice:\n- **Winds:** Jet streams blow strongly west to east at high altitude. Flights from Asia to Toronto get a tailwind, and airlines pick routes and altitudes to use it. Westbound flights from Toronto have to fight these winds, so the best route balances distance against wind.\n- **Airspace access:** Russian airspace is usually the most direct corridor. Since 2022, many Western airlines, including Canadian carriers, have been barred from it, so they take longer southern routes over the Pacific or through Central Asia. The polar advantage has shrunk as a result.\n- **Safety and infrastructure:** Polar routes depend on satellite communication, since radio coverage is limited. They also need emergency diversion airports, and there are fewer of them in the Arctic. Weather can change quickly, and search and rescue is far away. Airlines and regulators accept these risks because the routes are well planned and aircraft are certified for long-range, multi-engine operations.\n\nIn short, polar routes save time and fuel because Earth is round, and airlines adjust them for winds, airspace rules, and safety."}]},"stop_reason":"end_turn","usage":{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1240,"cache_read_input_tokens":4517,"cache_creation_input_tokens":93},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","refusal_category":null}]}
